            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop was requested for this remote run; the remote process exit, the SSH client close and the staging cleanup are not confirmed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已请求停止本次远程运行；无法确认远端进程是否退出、SSH 客户端是否关闭或暂存目录是否已清理。"
